Dialogue: 10,0:00:00.92,0:00:03.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki's late?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:04.28,0:00:07.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She said she was going to give me my present today.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.15,0:00:11.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe she's late because she\Nstayed up making something.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.27,0:00:12.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.11,0:00:13.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.16,0:00:14.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.04,0:00:15.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:15.82,0:00:18.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Worried about something?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.60,0:00:31.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.91,0:00:33.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Anybody home?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.30,0:00:35.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.24,0:00:46.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.00,0:00:56.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rubber boot prints?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.16,0:00:58.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're adult-male sized.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.52,0:01:01.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It last snowed two nights ago.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.03,0:01:07.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That means an adult male was here since then.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.34,0:01:12.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.48,0:01:20.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,53,,{\an8}Five musicians playing the flute and drums...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.14,0:01:25.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,53,,{\an8}Today's a fun Doll Festival.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.94,0:03:10.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I took the next two days off from school.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.20,0:03:16.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where's Mom? Out shopping?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.36,0:03:21.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Actually, a similar incident\Nhappened the next city over.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.82,0:03:26.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The culprit was caught soon afterwards,\Nbut now we have this.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.22,0:03:31.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We don't know who did this, but we'll have\Nto prevent it from happening again.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.61,0:03:35.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, but let me talk to the \Nschool about the media blackout.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.95,0:03:38.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll call you right after I do.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.71,0:03:42.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Got it. I'll let the editors know.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.21,0:03:43.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.67,0:03:47.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He must be one of Mom's former colleagues,\Na TV Ishikari reporter.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.76,0:03:52.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We don't want kids \Nremembering an incident like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.77,0:03:53.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.44,0:03:56.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So this is when it started?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.11,0:04:03.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I can understand being worried,\Nbut it ain't your fault.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.67,0:04:07.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I couldn't do a thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.74,0:04:09.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.79,0:04:13.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't want Hinazuki to be all alone anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.09,0:04:15.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, you managed that.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.16,0:04:18.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It wasn't enough. I could've done more.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.59,0:04:24.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's pointless to blame yourself\Nfor something after it happens.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.30,0:04:28.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There's only so much one person can do.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.65,0:04:30.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Be it you or me.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.76,0:04:32.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Go back to school tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.45,0:04:35.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You'll only get depressed being by yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.06,0:04:36.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.73,0:04:39.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Now, let's eat before it gets cold.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.59,0:04:40.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.29,0:04:46.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There's something I need to tell all of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.15,0:04:50.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What I said about Kayo \Nstaying home with a cold was a lie.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.93,0:04:54.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's actually been taken to her \Ngrandmother's place for family reasons.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.27,0:04:58.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It was all so sudden that she\N couldn't say goodbye to you guys,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.24,0:05:00.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,but I heard she's doing well in Sapporo.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.40,0:05:04.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did she run away?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.64,0:05:07.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I heard her mother was beating her.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.22,0:05:08.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's awful!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.83,0:05:10.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But this is good news.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.17,0:05:12.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.22,0:05:14.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let it get you down.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.80,0:05:16.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. You'll see her again.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.81,0:05:20.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.73,0:05:25.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,the Kayo story was something the school\Nand the PTA decided on together.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.11,0:05:28.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I ask that you go along with it for now.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.68,0:05:29.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.93,0:05:30.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.73,0:05:35.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It looks like there's a media blackout,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.24,0:05:40.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but there's been a police car parked \Nnear Hinazuki's place for the past few days.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.15,0:05:45.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Apparently, her mother's \Nalso a suspect at this stage.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.19,0:05:51.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And only six days after Hinazuki's disappearance...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.06,0:05:58.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,City Hall has issued an advisory.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.75,0:06:02.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You are to only leave the school grounds\Naccompanied by a guardian.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.37,0:06:06.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...the second victim disappeared.\NIt happened sooner than I expected.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.16,0:06:11.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did you hear, Satoru?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.82,0:06:15.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,About Nakanishi Aya from\NIzumi Elementary School?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.77,0:06:16.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.82,0:06:21.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A friend who goes there told me she ran away\Nand is now at her grandfather's place.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.73,0:06:24.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That sounds just like Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.30,0:06:27.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The running away thing is a lie, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.13,0:06:33.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is this a case of serial kidnapping?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.08,0:06:39.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}While there were a few minor differences,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.06,0:06:43.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}history was definitely \Nstarting to repeat itself.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.69,0:06:48.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The investigation was made public,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.38,0:06:53.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but TV Ishikari only ran the story\Nduring the early morning and late evening,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.16,0:06:58.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and city families with children were\Nadvised to only tune in to TV Ishikari.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.60,0:07:00.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.45,0:07:14.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The police car that was parked \Nall day and night near Hinazuki's place
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.13,0:07:17.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}only showed up every now and then\Nafter Nakanishi Aya's disappearance.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.85,0:07:21.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The focus of the investigation must\Nhave shifted to "serial kidnappings."
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.12,0:07:40.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just ten days after her daughter disappeared...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.83,0:07:45.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki's mother threw out a trash bag...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.06,0:07:49.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}with a pair of half-knit gloves inside.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.34,0:07:53.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll give you your present tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.38,0:07:55.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's a promise.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.96,0:08:19.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where am I?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.79,0:08:33.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I back in 2006?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.64,0:08:38.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,23-1 on Fourth.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.05,0:08:41.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The victim is Fujinuma Sachiko, 52 years old.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.14,0:08:45.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We're currently searching for the prime suspect, 29-year-old Fujinuma Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.52,0:08:47.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We have an eyewitness testimony. Over.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.95,0:08:48.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.48,0:08:53.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,Are you Fujinuma Satoru-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.65,0:08:55.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}Wrong. You're wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.22,0:08:57.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}I didn't do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.19,0:09:00.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.80,0:09:05.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I couldn't save Hinazuki, my mother's \Nbeen murdered, and I'm the prime suspect!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.61,0:09:08.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's the reality I'm facing right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.62,0:09:12.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to prepare myself...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.67,0:09:14.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and run away!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.47,0:09:23.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I could only think of hiding under a bridge.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.11,0:09:24.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have no imagination.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.52,0:09:27.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not like it'd be on the news yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.52,0:09:30.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to think first.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.49,0:09:34.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why was Mom murdered? Is it because\Nshe'd realized who the culprit was?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.26,0:09:38.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Was her cell phone in the apartment?\NWhat about her bag?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.74,0:09:43.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They were both nowhere to be found.\NDid the culprit take them?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.65,0:09:49.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Was it because there's a chance \Nshe'd leaked information about him?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.71,0:09:51.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shit!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.74,0:09:57.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My head feels heavy.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.30,0:10:00.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wish I could get some proper sleep,\Nat least for tonight.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.65,0:10:10.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, eat up.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.26,0:10:11.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.89,0:10:13.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry about today.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.41,0:10:16.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's the first time you've gone AWOL.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.96,0:10:18.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Katagiri-kun was worried about you too.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.14,0:10:21.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Knowing you, I'm sure you had a good reason.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.38,0:10:24.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, eat first, talk later.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.53,0:10:25.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I will, thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.84,0:10:31.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you had a fight with your mother.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.63,0:10:33.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.46,0:10:36.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Old people can be pretty stubborn.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.93,0:10:41.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Feel free to stay as long as you want,\Nbut be sure to make up with her.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.84,0:10:42.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.95,0:10:44.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Want a beer too?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.80,0:10:45.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.67,0:10:47.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Damn, I'm out.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.46,0:10:50.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll go grab some more.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.65,0:10:56.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was right to think he's an\Nannoying big brother type.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.32,0:10:59.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sorry I lied to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.74,0:11:03.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,After receiving a tip, \Nthe police rushed to the scene
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.64,0:11:08.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,and found a woman's body, presumed to be\Nthe mother of the apartment's resident.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.58,0:11:12.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The police are currently searching\Nfor the missing male resident
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.53,0:11:15.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,as a person of interest in this case.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.51,0:11:18.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This seriously couldn't get any worse now!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.69,0:11:21.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Next up, sports.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.25,0:11:26.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Today, the Japanese soccer team left\Nfor Germany for the World Cup finals.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.19,0:11:30.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How could I be so naïve?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.40,0:11:32.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, I can't hold it against him!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.65,0:11:34.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He always tries to do the right thing!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.98,0:11:36.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course he'd give me up!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.09,0:11:38.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.90,0:11:51.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.83,0:11:55.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Airi...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.82,0:11:59.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's the first time you've \Ncalled me Airi, Satoru-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.80,0:12:04.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You know you can't leave your phone on.\NThey'll track you through GPS.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.24,0:12:10.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Hop on already.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.67,0:12:12.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You have to run, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.32,0:12:23.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry you got dragged into this, Katagiri-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.49,0:12:24.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I think you mean Airi.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.87,0:12:26.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And now we're even in terms of bike rides.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.61,0:12:29.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want me in your house?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.96,0:12:31.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You know what happened, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.11,0:12:35.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The police came to the restaurant today\Nand talked to the manager about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.75,0:12:37.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It was on the news too.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.85,0:12:39.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Then why?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.88,0:12:41.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.02,0:12:45.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way you'd kill such a caring mother.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.88,0:12:47.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.97,0:12:50.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.10,0:12:52.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No need to thank me!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.03,0:12:56.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're being chased when\Nyou're the one who's hurt the most by this.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.32,0:13:01.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Trouble seems to follow you around, though, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.44,0:13:05.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Like this one.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.20,0:13:07.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You left this at work the other day.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.92,0:13:11.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I took the liberty of reading\Nthe part you had bookmarked.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.32,0:13:13.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It happened in your hometown\Nwhen you were a kid, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.14,0:13:16.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The Hinazuki Kayo-chan murder case.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.48,0:13:20.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe she died on\Nthe day of the Doll Festival.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.24,0:13:21.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I cried when I read that.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.72,0:13:23.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Doll Festival?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.33,0:13:26.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Says it happened on March 3rd.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.57,0:13:31.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, relax for a bit.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.79,0:13:34.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I have to go return the bike to work.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.79,0:13:37.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't take one step outside this room, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.43,0:13:45.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}The book's contents have changed.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.64,0:13:48.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So history can be changed...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.57,0:13:52.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I can go back there one more time,\NI can still save Hinazuki!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.69,0:14:05.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, right. I slept in Airi's room.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.68,0:14:07.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To Satoru-san,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.41,0:14:12.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think I should go about business\Nas usual today, so I'm off to work.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.27,0:14:17.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My family said they're going out at 10 a.m.,\Nand that they won't be back until after 8 p.m.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.80,0:14:21.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You can find the house \Nand bike keys next to the clock.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.36,0:14:24.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My mobile number is...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.31,0:14:29.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not Katagiri?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.82,0:14:34.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I really don't know how \Nto thank you, Nishizono-sensei!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.74,0:14:39.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's fine. Your father has always helped me out.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.59,0:14:42.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, let me!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.65,0:14:44.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,My dad is overjoyed, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.36,0:14:49.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,He's amazed how much one traffic light \Nand crosswalk has increased our foot traffic.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.34,0:14:53.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That just means your father is a smart businessman.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.60,0:14:57.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,All I did was lend him a hand.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.56,0:15:01.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Besides, that's a school route.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.20,0:15:05.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We would discuss it often at city council meetings.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.04,0:15:07.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm heading home. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.88,0:15:10.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sure. Bye, Airi-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.93,0:15:11.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.65,0:15:14.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, takeout pizza.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.07,0:15:17.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You should've told me! \NI can treat you once in a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.90,0:15:20.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, but that's okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.92,0:15:22.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's for a friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.46,0:15:26.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, a friend? A-A girl?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.92,0:15:30.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, see you.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.63,0:15:35.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's cute, isn't she?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.02,0:15:42.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! But she's only 17,\Nso she's kind of a child...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.47,0:15:46.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I should get going too.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.71,0:15:49.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.20,0:16:04.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Airi-kun!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.02,0:16:07.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Manager?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.32,0:16:10.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You forgot this. It comes with\N the current promotion, remember?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.82,0:16:12.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.24,0:16:16.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, about Satoru-kun...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.44,0:16:19.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine him killing his...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.97,0:16:23.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, doing something like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.80,0:16:24.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.91,0:16:29.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If you happen to run into him, help him out.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.93,0:16:30.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.82,0:16:33.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll offer my support as well, so call me if you meet him.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.48,0:16:35.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.25,0:16:45.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can I really close in on the killer by looking this up?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.57,0:16:51.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A kidnapping case in the city three years ago?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.15,0:16:54.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I do remember something like that happening.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.94,0:17:00.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The suspect was arrested three weeks later,\Nbut he vehemently maintained his innocence.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.40,0:17:04.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is this feeling?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.57,0:17:06.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Something feels off.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.43,0:17:23.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you calling the police?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.44,0:17:24.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Airi-kun!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.61,0:17:27.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You told me to help Satoru-san out.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.88,0:17:31.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You said you would offer your support, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.01,0:17:36.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Y-You've got it all wrong, Airi-kun!\NI was, uh, just worried about you!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.52,0:17:46.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Then why didn't you just say so from the start?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.06,0:17:48.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I wanted to trust you!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.27,0:17:52.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I-I was worried about you...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.53,0:17:55.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That, I believe.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.91,0:17:57.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.13,0:17:59.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Please, I beg of you...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.13,0:18:02.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If you really are worried about me,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.35,0:18:06.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,please don't call the police to the house\Nof the family that's taking care of me.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.09,0:18:18.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Satoru-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.80,0:18:20.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You have nothing to apologize for.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.96,0:18:22.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If anything, I should thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.40,0:18:25.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I managed to get some rest, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.69,0:18:28.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We can't go back to that house anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.60,0:18:30.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's for the best.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.58,0:18:34.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which,\N that's not your family home, is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.69,0:18:37.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No. My mother's brother and his wife live there.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.92,0:18:40.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,My family home is out in the country.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.01,0:18:42.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Instead of finding a boarding house\Nso I could go to high school,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.99,0:18:46.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,they told me to come stay\Nwith them here in Chiba.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.56,0:18:49.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Can I ask you another question?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.72,0:18:50.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.25,0:18:55.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How can you trust me?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.03,0:19:00.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's not that I {\i1}can{\i0} trust you.\NI {\i1}want{\i0} to trust you.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.23,0:19:07.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Back when I was in grade school,\NI once went shopping with my dad.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.59,0:19:14.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The owner caught him trying \Nto leave with chocolate in his pocket.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.64,0:19:17.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We lived in a small town,\Nand the owner was a friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.49,0:19:21.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,He said he'd forget about it if my father\Nadmitted to stealing it and apologized.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.60,0:19:24.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But my dad adamantly refused.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.94,0:19:29.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That was the first time I heard\Nmy calm and gentle father yell.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.79,0:19:32.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The owner was left no\Nchoice but to call the police,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.62,0:19:38.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,and my dad was suspended from his post \Nat the local farming co-op for three months.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.60,0:19:42.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I know because I was watching the \Nwhole time! I know you didn't do it, Dad!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.65,0:19:48.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,My dad quit the co-op,\Ngot a divorce, and left home.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.70,0:19:53.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I guess my mom thought he actually did it.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.01,0:20:00.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's for my own sake that I want to trust you.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.35,0:20:03.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Similar to someone wanting to be trusted,\Nbut the other way around.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.29,0:20:09.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Go back home. Tell the police\NI threatened you into hiding me.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.41,0:20:11.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.61,0:20:15.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can get away by yourself,\Nand I refuse to tell them that.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.05,0:20:19.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Could you stop asking me if I'm stupid?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.76,0:20:20.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.03,0:20:25.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll at least bring you a change of clothes.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.18,0:20:31.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The manager didn't call\Nthe police after that, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.74,0:20:42.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.88,0:20:44.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.66,0:20:48.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did Satoru-san find his mother's phone?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.46,0:20:50.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.04,0:20:52.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.08,0:20:53.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's from the killer!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.58,0:20:55.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Stay right where you are."?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.33,0:21:00.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A-Are you kidding me?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.22,0:21:04.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.93,0:21:06.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No way!

